      "returns.label.created": "Return labels: charge a seller-paid label to the seller, record a platform shipping expense, or a platform label cost when the customer pays (the fee deducted from the refund is recovered from the seller share when the refund is sent). Keyed by labelId",
      "shipping.label.purchased": "Outbound and replacement labels: charge seller-bought labels to the seller ledger, record company labels as Official Store shipping expense and platform labels as platform cost. kind = return is ignored (booked from returns.label.created)",
      "shipping.label.voided": "Reverse the charge or expense booked for that labelId (any kind)",
      "shipping.claim.status_changed": "paid: credit paidAmount to whoever bore the loss (seller ledger or company trading); other statuses are kept for reconciliation",
      "promotions.coupon.redeemed": "Record discount funding (platform vs seller) for fee basis and discount reports",
      "promotions.redemption.reversed": "Reverse the recorded discount funding (platform and seller parts) for the order item, so fee basis and discount reports match after a cancellation or refund",
      "payments.refund.failed": "Mark the refund's stored funding split failed (nothing is posted until payments.refund.sent); on the final attempt list it in the daily reconciliation",
      "sellers.seller.approved": "Open the seller account and apply the new-seller hold rule",
      "sellers.seller.suspended": "Put the seller's pending payouts on hold with reason restriction (review date from the restriction)",
      "sellers.seller.reinstated": "After a suspension (from suspended): clear the payout block it set, release its hold on the available balance (restriction_hold) and put the payouts it held back to pending",
      "sellers.seller.closed": "Issue a final statement and schedule the last payout after open obligations",
      "sellers.payout_account.changed": "Open a destination review; keep paying the current verified destination",
      "access.approval.decided": "Finish approval-required holds, adjustments, corrections, payout runs, fee rule changes and seller credits (finance.credits.issue: post or reject, publish finance.seller_credit.decided)",
      "support.case.decided": "Release or apply dispute holds linked to the case",
      "wallet.credit.granted": "Phase 3: record the store-credit liability (refund to credit, goodwill, gift cards). Only kind goodwill with chargedTo platform is booked as a platform cost; chargedTo seller is posted to the seller's earnings",
      "wallet.credit.used": "Phase 3: reduce the store-credit liability when credit pays for an order",
      "wallet.credit.reversed": "Phase 3: a goodwill grant was reversed (unused credit removed): reduce the store-credit liability by the amount; chargedTo seller: credit the seller back the goodwill charge posted for the grant (keyed by grantEntryId, never more than was charged); chargedTo platform: reduce the platform goodwill cost. Keyed by entryId",
      "wallet.credit.expired": "Phase 3: unused credit expired: reduce the store-credit liability (expired credit is recorded as platform breakage, not seller money). Keyed by entryId",
      "wallet.credit.corrected": "Phase 3: staff corrected a balance: increase (positive) or reduce (negative) the store-credit liability, booked as a platform credit correction with the reason. Keyed by entryId"
